      "action": "raw",
      "text": "Prepare and prime a 96.96 Dynamic ArrayTM  Integrated Fluidic Circuit (IFC) according to the manufacturer’s instructions. Briefly,inject one control line fluid syringe into each accumulator on the  chip, and then prime the chip on the IFC Controller for approximately 20 minutes."
